flowchart LR
  P[Evidence preflight] --> F[Freeze legacy starts and claims]
  F --> R{Reconcile every semantic job}
  R -->|resolved| E[Activate jobs/Graphile epoch]
  R -->|ambiguous| A[Abort and quarantine]
  E --> V[Synthetics and legacy-zero checks]
  V --> O[24h soak then remove executable legacy]
